  "releaseNotes": "--APR 2026: Added HttpClientExtensions and SocketExtensions, applied trimming annotations, and expanded benchmark coverage across extension methods.\n\t  --MAY 2026: Optimized ArrayExtensions (CRAP score analysis), refactored StringBuilderExtensions and member iteration for performance, and switched collection conversions to the range operator.\n\t  --JUN-JUL 2026: Added full benchmark coverage for all extension methods and improved trim safety and validation.\n\t  --AUG 2026: Improved SocketExtensions, added ColorExtensions.Average coverage, refreshed collection/string/type extension benchmarks, and marked many extension APIs as stable.\n\t  --OCT 2026: Fixed ColorExtensions.Average with expanded unit test coverage, updated SocketExtensions documentation status, marked ArrayExtensions, CollectionExtensions, DateTimeExtensions, DictionaryExtensions, NumericExtensions, StreamExtensions, StringExtensions, FileInfoExtensions, DirectoryInfoExtensions, MemoryExtensions, MessagePackExtensions, ReadOnlyMemoryExtensions, OpenTelemetryExtensions, and EfCoreModelBuilderExtensions APIs as stable, and updated OpenTelemetry.Api dependency to 1.18.0.",
